  {
   "id": "MESSAGE041:0766",
   "jp": "な、何だと…",
   "en": "Wh-what..."
  },
  {
   "id": "MESSAGE041:076E",
   "jp": "貴様には…\n必ずや罰が下るだろう……!",
   "en": "You... will surely face\njudgment......!"
  },
  {
   "id": "MESSAGE041:0786",
   "jp": "こ、腰が抜けた…",
